# Portfolio (Static)

## Run locally
This is plain HTML/CSS/JS. Use any static server.

From the `portfolio/` folder:

```bash
python -m http.server 5500
```

Open:
http://localhost:5500

## Replace images
- Profile image: `assets/profile.jpg`
- Project images:
  - `assets/projects/voice-assistant.jpg`
  - `assets/projects/marketplace.jpg`
  - `assets/projects/education-dms.jpg`

## Replace placeholders
Update in `index.html`:
- Brand name / “Your Name”
- Resume link: `assets/resume.pdf`
- GitHub + LinkedIn URLs
- Email: `mailto:yourname@example.com`
